{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1246246","title":"Deciphering microbial responses to H2S inhibition of typical functional microorganisms in anaerobic digestion ecosystems","description":"This project explores how typical functional microbial groups, such as sulfate-reducing bacteria (SRB), methanogens, and syntrophic bacteria respond to hydrogen sulfide (H2S) stress during anaerobic digestion of sulfate-rich wastewater. By comparing sequencing batch reactors (SBRs) and continuous flow reactors (CFRs) under different COD/sulfate ratios, the study provides insights into microbial degradation performance, community dynamics, and detoxification mechanisms under sulfide inhibition.","center":"University of Galway","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2025/04/03 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN47771444","Wastewater sludge from SBR reactor with COD/Sulfate=2:1","non_environmental",null,"2024-01-09",2024,"IE","Connacht",2964180,"Galway","verified",53.2784,-9.0622,"Ireland: University of Galway, Galway",null,"wastewater treatment plant [ENVO:00002043]","anaerobic bioreactor [ENVO:00002124]","anaerobic sludge [ENVO:00002129]","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN47771445","Wastewater sludge from SBR reactor with COD/Sulfate=1:1","non_environmental",null,"2024-01-09",2024,"IE","Connacht",2964180,"Galway","verified",53.2784,-9.0622,"Ireland: University of Galway, Galway",null,"wastewater treatment plant [ENVO:00002043]","anaerobic bioreactor [ENVO:00002124]","anaerobic sludge [ENVO:00002129]","laboratory or culture material"],["SAMN47771446","Wastewater sludge from CFR reactor with COD/Sulfate=2:1","non_environmental",null,"2024-01-09",2024,"IE","Connacht",2964180,"Galway","verified",53.2784,-9.0622,"Ireland: Uni